WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:02.526
Find the perfect squares either side.

2
00:00:03.254 --> 00:00:05.879
Six squared is thirty-six: too small.

3
00:00:06.656 --> 00:00:11.506
Seven squared is forty-nine: too big. The root is between six and seven.

4
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:15.760
Try tenths. Six point six squared is very close.
